#: scenario5:scenario5_0645E338_30D8_4F9C_B63C_904B2053A2DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcb3dbb9684f3c8fd9d611fa190ad5f06c8d4a60b106e1df1cd0d95b77dde432
#. default-sha256: 7a5975d50d4fdf73c517be37761c59632635f59da83822a30450c27034e372bd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0645E338_30D8_4F9C_B63C_904B2053A2DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 278942160897d98f168fb2be90e6e29130358e26c408a81e621ac815ba01f37c
#. default-sha256: 0c07b6974be5a47b7a288d21d2f9ba324ad95a55492cddfd93ad5ca3324b47aa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did we get to this point?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜 이렇게 된 걸까……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7a9cb3c5a5d2abf771e7faaf1747b429b02cb8c31ebc0a179f9fc10ebb87f8f
#. default-sha256: ba168afd486b460736b8c44ece51666d7b4b070f8ec8a3aeb665617445e2a0ca
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ugh... ⟪k:1⟫I hate everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아……, ⟪k:1⟫……끔찍해."

#: scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0699617fee4a6a04af4c3b634b3b5bbd477de36e1f2564bf0e8ed97e3767f8b
#. default-sha256: 37e3370d37a20966376beb85fe1f3be7505fe6f536198d8d2504e58e45d58bd8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My spirits were getting darker and darker, like they were slowly sinking into a deep morass."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 마음은 ⟪k:1⟫늪 밑바닥으로 끌려가는 것처럼 ⟪k:2⟫침울하게 ⟪k:3⟫가라앉아 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f04c312b02ec935b833c93cb0b05e70310a202dc5e226aa461f61fd34d7d6eb
#. default-sha256: ed374d10a5c9ffa1cb8a35da914123278410f96594325faff0d27e689ce80d41
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been at the mansion for a month, ⟪k:1⟫and every day since felt twice as long as it "
"should have."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 저택에 온 지 한 달. ⟪k:1⟫……그건 ⟪k:2⟫하루가 매우 길게 느껴지는 시간이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 122d32c9b3a811bc0f6407f8974d2e27e4df9427727681958092220e1252ebfd
#. default-sha256: d359fcbfd5f55550a70e07352e719d0eaa55bea78cb7d32e37d0bbba40a8141d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been optimistic, at first. ⟪k:1⟫I’d even had a little hope that me and Michel could "
"get along together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫처음에는 긍정적으로 생각했다. ⟪k:1⟫기대도 조금 했다. ⟪k:2⟫미셸과 잘해 나갈 수 있을 거라 믿었"
"다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c5b398b2a5111200fffac2e443a543008acc755c5daacb515eaef2b60c67981
#. default-sha256: 0164403fbe20402111c66f289db9e98e23e990d1015b714c67d442c338ddc23f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it hadn’t taken long for that hope to be shattered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그런 희망은 이른 단계에서 무너졌고――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f760ccadb31755b1d3589f33a15b59306918bb29f26cead39e2b8bbccdcf2fd5
#. default-sha256: 3238639a3280a91d3e1ee68cf441980881ece98e4bde6925ede4b3254fe9e261
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the cheer locked away inside me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 기분이 들뜰 일은 ⟪k:1⟫없어졌다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b3494f1fb6a04e0557554b3b0143f0bf999cf233a506a336a57c71ff8496488
#. default-sha256: ea747f7c2430524d88833419a3ed499b8292dbc4577b0031b39cf65247a985d9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We lived in the same house, but we never spoke anymore. ⟪k:1⟫On the few occasions we ⟪k:2⟫"
"did⟪k:3⟫ cross paths, he just gave me a cold glare and nothing more,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지금은 ⟪k:1⟫같은 곳에 살면서도 말 한마디 안 나누며…… 마주치더라도 ⟪k:2⟫싸늘한 눈총을 받을 뿐."

#: scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abd215006b352f5dc6f1cd8865b5160c55e157add07439737965d2cbdafaec2a
#. default-sha256: 25cc24d952d8fb86d036f898a5038aff3b260ff9ce654a67c71e6e29a017411c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫scorn and suspicion in his eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나를 의심하며 ⟪k:1⟫혐오하는 눈."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6203c8869cfe85101caa81428c04ee8c887b6d8f597d1c8a79533efc77c8ab84
#. default-sha256: 76ac69f276ee342314d0e738530cd137b647d86746a7f210939a62497f090ecd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whenever he looked at me like that, it felt as though my throat was being constricted—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫like I was deep underwater and running out of air."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫압박감을 느꼈다. ⟪k:1⟫물 속에서 숨을 못 쉬고 ⟪k:2⟫허덕이는 것처럼……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7068e6b3bc94cf150b837f294fb849e34d563b3e74a1e18531e2b5f3dcaaa23
#. default-sha256: ed2df04309beade9bec81e4ec97963790ef5198a45c9a121dca979552469f971
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like my very presence in the world was a crime."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 존재하는 게 ⟪k:1⟫용납되지 않는 것 같았다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4333094ac2ee98ec19a5e81620d0ffe9a7a54d262bf6750f339ee6bf93687c99
#. default-sha256: a36ab97e44f1d42952cbf565e51ddaf910c2849bafc7f02a54ca2b9a51d5f89f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I never could have imagined just how agonizing constant rejection was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫남에게 부정당하는 나날이 ⟪k:1⟫이토록 힘겨울 줄은 몰랐다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0ce1985720e3c437e307902f271ed27e030d6bea8c2633bd0dfef55b8885f5e
#. default-sha256: 1be418fac9037c5d40b15f2068d7f1d44daaf2faa44a0d2bd7361646c3925f41
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I started despising others. ⟪k:1⟫Despising myself. ⟪k:2⟫Despising the world. ⟪k:3⟫Convinced "
"there was no one who could set me free."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……남이 싫어지고 ⟪k:1⟫나 자신도 싫어진다. ⟪k:2⟫세상이 싫어진다. ⟪k:3⟫끝내 아무도 나를 구하지 "
"않는단…… 생각까지 들게 하는 나날."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4931afc8d408d885e131fe14ab5bf5aa1ed9deb0624ab3852f008937c012d375
#. default-sha256: 608f58370dad7e00456d0dc66bfbfa0bc5a53c5501c3b6ba8f4ac997adc8e38c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I considered running away from everything,⟪k:1⟫rather than live like this another day,⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫but I would have done so long ago⟪k:4⟫if that were actually an option."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런 나날이 이어질 바에는 ⟪k:1⟫차라리 도망치고 싶다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫하지만 ⟪k:4⟫그게 가능하면 ⟪k:5⟫"
"진작에 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17c1531a4a20e7315066ea3a41e5ce1a64f58ddfe8cc27aac14c179fc7722983
#. default-sha256: 758b51ce690b534dc25c75665e58445c22af7ed3c62a9e9cb84c3ed6f5a7d5a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If they found out I had fled—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that I had acted outside their wishes—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫my mom and sister would pay."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내가 도망친 게 드러나면……, ⟪k:1⟫죄의 청산을 거부한 게 드러나면, ⟪k:2⟫엄마와 언니가 힘들어질 "
"수도 있다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6c8705b7318d9f58278ad34ec939b445ac0e8ab14919cd30ddf6cb868a72d54
#. default-sha256: 742859461f6da46712eaef2f3c5f7c215755b5e85a106e0599bf3ed2b7b473e3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had succeeded in allowing my sister to get married and my mom to live comfortably."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫결혼한 언니……, ⟪k:1⟫생활고 걱정을 던 엄마.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 둘에게 행복을 주었으니――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9357a03f31e3df20a4169871b8c24e0a2450c5448faa9e651e4c3ea60c2bed93
#. default-sha256: a805a2eb66f8f5ffa874204ce705398d79a4480172e28204c619ea115718fea5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had given them happiness. ⟪k:1⟫I couldn’t take that away from them again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그걸 없애는 짓은 ⟪k:1⟫차마 못 한다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cf343acf520945c654efe7dbaf751d737ecc73eae08a5f54b5f29f092389b29
#. default-sha256: 5120640530e475da171b050f9ad8adc6f92e0970f86504d6647303b4d12f045b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not after what I had to go through to do it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫더구나 ⟪k:1⟫내가…… 그런 꼴을 겪으면서까지……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e724bd0db0076da14172cce5a6d55392b5ba6a923415f0af2b4d3dc578f03bae
#. default-sha256: 8258aac0985b556639147ec3a838318ad62556636fcf21a94dae43122878295f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, no, cut that out. ⟪k:1⟫Getting way too depressing, Giselle.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(아아, ⟪k:1⟫이럼 안 되는데……. ⟪k:2⟫하아, ⟪k:3⟫사고가 점점 암울해져)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0e95dcf35a8eaf76f94d6f3ea8d4f92d08d0b5f7057c1f25a325987fb420349
#. default-sha256: 7475ab8dd3f20f2f4b54faa5c24c8395719b554cf3744886ec365aee662810ff
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Pull yourself together! That’s not who you are!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(정신 잘 차려야지, ⟪k:1⟫지젤! ⟪k:2⟫난 ⟪k:3⟫이런 인간이 아니잖아!)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1faed4cab1f0d8505da15f2356a9a3c4f86ea236adadb287bcdd73756d3285b
#. default-sha256: 3c1f1fab21c2d7b5724bf5f250be56131b3b0218e6499cf16ee598f830edb3d8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Be positive...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(정신 잘……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbc3eb55aa0e159006c91f1fe9564b88bfafc2f9a14bbc9fe7b595a22c304212
#. default-sha256: 26109a609add566a8ffa54de9fea4e11e71cf1630d8f927bf80271f5fe77b64d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The negativity didn’t only come from my interactions with Michel, either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 사람과 지내는 것만이―― ⟪k:1⟫이러는 이유는 아니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫왠지 ⟪k:4⟫이 저택에는……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d00de5919d944910458cdc3e707f0609ca95c32344625654b547105064c07ff8
#. default-sha256: c9f0b59727831ccdb4fee6a65a90c03d5f24af8fadf8850797adecea6a217dc3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, there seemed to be some kind of terrible presence within the mansion that twisted "
"people’s hearts."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사람의 감정을 일그러지게 하는 흉흉한 무언가가 ⟪k:1⟫눌어붙은 것만 같았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 911331ba6d54e708585300d6e65eb6c8be2c615b7d7a655ba964514b57b3353e
#. default-sha256: eb43cb38c83d88f82d18de4d4131b31a587a3fe50c3e409fe910ad7e87476694
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion was, in fact, a bit of a local legend, which I had been informed about before "
"being sent here."
